 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Four kings marched to war that day",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Against the five in the valley",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Twelve years they served Chedorlaomer",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But in the thirteenth, they rebelled",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Valley of Siddim had pits",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where kings of Sodom fell",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The goods of Sodom were seized",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Lot was taken away",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I raised my hand to God Most High",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Maker of heaven and earth",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will accept nothing from you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not a thread or sandal strap",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So you can never say",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I made Abram rich",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Three hundred eighteen men arose",
   "heard": 2,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Born in Abram\u2019s household",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He pursued the army to Dan",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And struck them by night",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He recovered all the goods",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And brought back Lot his kinsman",
